# 11. Basic Brute-Force Detection Workflow

```text
SSH Logs
   ↓
Find failed authentication events
   ↓
Extract source IP
   ↓
Count attempts
   ↓
Look for repeated attempts
   ↓
Check successful authentication
   ↓
Investigate account activity
   ↓
Determine whether further action is required
```

