# 📊 15. SOC Detection Logic

A basic detection rule can be represented as:

```text
IF

SSH authentication failures >= threshold

AND

multiple failures originate from the same source IP

AND

events occur within a short time window

THEN

flag the source for investigation.
```

Example:

```text
Source IP: 192.168.1.50
Failed attempts: 15
Time window: 2 minutes
Target: SSH
Status: Investigation required
```

